  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  v4k_8tile        1  318.1 [315.3..321.2]  322.7 [320.3..325.5]  246.5 [245.5..246.8]
  v4k_8tile        2  197.8 [196.7..199.9]  166.8 [165.9..167.4]  125.2 [125.0..125.3]
