  v4k_8tile        8   67.1 [ 64.9.. 68.8]   52.7 [ 50.1.. 55.1]   35.7 [ 34.3.. 36.7]
  v4k_8tile_10b    1  358.3 [357.2..362.8]  363.4 [361.7..366.3]  251.3 [250.9..251.6]
  v4k_8tile_10b    2  206.1 [205.5..207.6]  188.6 [187.3..190.2]  127.6 [127.5..127.8]
